    "text": {
        "id": "0",
        "type": 1,
        "elements": [
            {
                "id": "0,0",
                "type": 2,
                "elements": [
                    {
                        "id": "0,0,0",
                        "type": 3,
                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "id": "0,0,0,0",
                                "type": 4,
                                "elements": "There are many different systems of units.",
                                "format_id": "d3382bac-1c7e-42a4-9e7d-8d091499b932"
                            }
                        ],
                        "format_name": "Text body"
                    }
                ],
                "format_name": "Text body",
                "format_alignment": 0
            },
            {
                "id": "0,1",
                "type": 2,
                "elements": [
                    {
                        "id": "0,1,0",
                        "type": 3,
                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "id": "0,1,0,0",
                                "type": 4,
                                "elements": "At the moment, only three systems of units are built-in - SI, russian and american. The metric system is accepted in the program by default. All other units, including those of other systems, are based on its units.",
                                "format_id": "d3382bac-1c7e-42a4-9e7d-8d091499b932"
                            }
                        ],
                        "format_name": "Text body"
                    }
                ],
                "format_name": "Text body",
                "format_alignment": 0
            },
            {
                "id": "0,2",
                "type": 2,
                "elements": [
                    {
                        "id": "0,2,0",
                        "type": 3,
                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "id": "0,2,0,0",
                                "type": 4,
                                "elements": "The previous chapter showed the declaration of user-defined dimensions. All those examples refer to the metric system. To declare a unit of another system, the system name must be explicitly written in the subscript when declaring the unit (keys [Ctrl+Shift+S] or the button ",
                                "format_id": "d3382bac-1c7e-42a4-9e7d-8d091499b932"
                            },
                            {
                                "id": "0,2,0,1",
                                "type": 34,
                                "elements": [],
                                "image_base64": ""
                            },
                            {
                                "id": "0,2,0,2",
                                "type": 4,
                                "elements": "):",
                                "format_id": "d3382bac-1c7e-42a4-9e7d-8d091499b932"
                            }
                        ],
                        "format_name": "Text body"
                    }
                ],
